msgstr "Auto (beste)"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Renderer"
msgstr "Renderer"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Software"
msgstr "Software"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Which renderer draws the game. Applies on the\n"
"next launch - save settings and relaunch."
msgstr ""
"Welke renderer het spel tekent. Geldt bij de\n"
"volgende start - sla op en start opnieuw."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Window size"
msgstr "Venstergrootte"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Width"
msgstr "Breedte"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Height"
msgstr "Hoogte"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "1x (native)"
msgstr "1x (origineel)"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "8x (4K)"
msgstr "8x (4K)"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "3D render scale"
msgstr "3D-renderschaal"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Internal 3D rendering resolution. Higher is crisper 3D\n"
"(2D/HUD stays sharp). GPU backends only; the software\n"
"renderer stays native. Applies on the next launch - save\n"
"settings and relaunch."
msgstr ""
"Interne 3D-renderresolutie. Hoger geeft scherpere 3D\n"
"(2D/HUD blijft scherp). Alleen GPU-backends; de software-\n"
"renderer blijft origineel. Geldt bij de volgende start -\n"
"sla de instellingen op en start opnieuw."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Bilinear"
msgstr "Bilineair"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Integer"
msgstr "Geheel getal"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Nearest"
msgstr "Dichtstbijzijnde"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Sharp-bilinear"
msgstr "Scherp-bilineair"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "2D scaling"
msgstr "2D-schaling"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"How the frame is magnified to the window.\n"
"Sharp-bilinear keeps 2D text crisp without the shimmer\n"
"nearest shows at non-integer window sizes. Integer snaps\n"
"to a whole multiple (pixel-perfect, with black bars).\n"
"Applies live."
msgstr ""
"Hoe het beeld naar het venster wordt vergroot.\n"
"Scherp-bilineair houdt 2D-tekst scherp zonder het flikkeren\n"
"van dichtstbijzijnde bij niet-gehele venstergroottes. Geheel\n"
"getal kiest een heel veelvoud (pixelperfect, met zwarte balken).\n"
"Geldt direct."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "4:3 (arcade)"
msgstr "4:3 (arcade)"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Square pixels"
msgstr "Vierkante pixels"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Stretch"
msgstr "Uitrekken"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Aspect"
msgstr "Beeldverhouding"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"4:3 is the arcade monitor's shape (the default).\n"
"Square pixels shows the raw 496x384 (slightly narrow).\n"
"Stretch fills the whole window. Applies live."
msgstr ""
"4:3 is de vorm van de arcademonitor (standaard).\n"
"Vierkante pixels toont de ruwe 496x384 (iets smal).\n"
"Uitrekken vult het hele venster. Geldt direct."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "CRT filter"
msgstr "CRT-filter"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A cosmetic arcade-monitor look over the finished frame:\n"
"scanlines, an RGB shadow mask, glow and optional screen\n"
"curvature. Purely visual; applies live."
msgstr ""
"Een cosmetische arcademonitor-look over het beeld:\n"
"scanlines, een RGB-schaduwmasker, gloed en optionele\n"
"schermkromming. Puur visueel; geldt direct."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Scanlines"
msgstr "Scanlines"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Mask"
msgstr "Masker"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Glow"
msgstr "Gloed"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Curvature"
msgstr "Kromming"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Enhancement (cosmetic, beyond the original hardware)"
msgstr "Verbetering (cosmetisch, voorbij de originele hardware)"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Anisotropic"
msgstr "Anisotroop"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Faithful"
msgstr "Getrouw"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "3D texture filter"
msgstr "3D-texturefilter"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "(unsupported)"
msgstr "(niet ondersteund)"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "This GPU does not report anisotropic filtering."
msgstr "Deze GPU meldt geen anisotrope filtering."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Anisotropy"
msgstr "Anisotropie"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "2D upscale"
msgstr "2D-upscaling"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Edge-smooth the 2D layers (HUD, text, menus). xBR and\n"
"ScaleFX round diagonals; Faithful keeps crisp pixels.\n"
"Applies live."
msgstr ""
"Strijk de randen van de 2D-lagen glad (HUD, tekst, menu's).\n"
"xBR en ScaleFX ronden diagonalen af; Getrouw houdt\n"
"scherpe pixels. Geldt direct."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Blended"
msgstr "Gemengd"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Stipple"
msgstr "Raster"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Translucency"
msgstr "Doorschijnendheid"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The hardware draws see-through surfaces (lights, glass,\n"
"shadows) as a checkerboard. Blended draws the 50%\n"
"see-through surface it's trying to achieve. Applies live."
msgstr ""
"De hardware tekent doorzichtige vlakken (lichten, glas,\n"
"schaduwen) als een dambordpatroon. Gemengd tekent het\n"
"50% doorzichtige vlak dat bedoeld is. Geldt direct."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Custom textures"
msgstr "Eigen texturen"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Replace the game's 3D textures with images saved in\n"
"saves/textures/<game>/load, named as dumped. GPU\n"
"renderers only; Reload picks up edited files."
msgstr ""
"Vervang de 3D-texturen van het spel door afbeeldingen in\n"
"saves/textures/<game>/load, benoemd zoals gedumpt. Alleen\n"
"GPU-renderers; Herladen leest bewerkte bestanden opnieuw."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "%zu loaded"
msgstr "%zu geladen"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Reload"
msgstr "Herladen"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Dump textures"
msgstr "Texturen dumpen"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Collect every 3D texture the game draws and write them,\n"
"with an index.html to browse, to saves/textures/<game>/dump\n"
"when the game exits or this is turned off."
msgstr ""
"Verzamel elke 3D-texture die het spel tekent en schrijf ze,\n"
"met een index.html om te bladeren, naar saves/textures/<game>/dump\n"
"wanneer het spel stopt of dit wordt uitgeschakeld."

